- op: discuss  # 9d05
  at: '2026-07-26T03:05:21Z'  # 9d05
  by: agent  # 9d05
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9d05
  clock: 3  # 9d05
  nonce: 9d05  # 9d05
  message: "Fixed in GitHub PR #6 via Path 1 (human-approved). Root cause: the run_survey/run_behavior_map connectivity default was intentionally flipped True->False in 4c8a8f66c1 (D12: centrality-ranked default; --connectivity opt-in). That updated the argparse --help but left the RCT pin + 3 docstrings/help strings asserting the old True default, so the pin went permanently red the first time real GitHub/Woodpecker CI ran the full suite (Codeberg's dead CI had hidden it). Fix: the pin now guards connectivity's parameter PRESENCE (the surface the RCT actually depends on), not its default VALUE (a product knob the RCT overrides by passing connectivity=True explicitly); the 3 stale docs are reconciled to the centrality-ranked default. Behavioral evidence: re-ran the filed repro 'python -m pytest tests/test_rct_public_api_pinned.py::test_run_behavior_map_critical_params_pinned -o addopts=\"\" -q' -> now passes (previously AssertionError: connectivity default changed from True to False). RCT-coordination: mgumbo/dgumbo re-runs must pass connectivity=True EXPLICITLY for the connectivity-aware baseline; recorded in the pin breadcrumb comment + PR."  # 9d05
